<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's OTP buys Merkantil Bank.</title>
<headline>Hungary's OTP buys Merkantil Bank.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTP, Hungary's largest commercial bank said on Thursday it purchased Merkantil Bank Rt for 1.2 billion forints.</p>
<p>OTP deputy chief executive Adam Kolossvary was quoted by the Hungarian news agency as saying that Merkantil would continue to specialise in car leasing.</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 326 4040</p>
</text>
